+```text
+qualifyingPrefix(INPUT, K) +Int 1
+#Equals
+qualifyingPrefix(INPUT, K)
+```
+
+This was an expected unmet result obligation, not a parser error, missing
+import, timeout, or unrelated backend failure.
+
+Evidence:
