+| Claim | Definition | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| `LOOP-SPEC.loop-connection` | bridge-free | `#Top`, exit 0 |
+| `SPEC.add-elements` | bridge-bearing | `#Top`, exit 0 |
+| `LOOP-WITNESS-BASE.boundary-witness` | bridge-free | `#Top`, exit 0 |
